; aging.bp -- the quark FB1 and FB4 share (declarations only, so no
; program).  Its layout matches the native FB types, so the host draws
; both alike: fuse is mStg[0] (state bits 0..31), age is mStg[1] (bits
; 32..63, the counter the host colors by).

quark Aging
  unsigned fuse 32      ; FB1: events left before the kabam (0 = idle)
  unsigned age 32       ; +1 per event; the host colors by it
